node2 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>underInvestigationFor</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/underInvestigationFor' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/underInvestigationFor</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;The from /Security/Vulnerability impact is being investigated for each to Element. The use of the underInvestigationFor type is constrained to /Security/VexUnderInvestigationVulnAssessmentRelationship classed relationships.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;The from /Security/Vulnerability impact is being investigated for each to Element. The use of the underInvestigationFor type is constrained to /Security/VexUnderInvestigationVulnAssessmentRelationship classed relationships.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyAction node3
node3 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>ModifyAction</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyAction' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyAction</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;An actual alteration of a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;An actual alteration of a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A ModifyAction is an action that alters a product, such as a change to its configuration or its location.

Relationship:

For each ModifyAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of hasOutput on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.

For each ModifyAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of performedBy on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
