# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseListVersion node1158
node1158 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>licenseListVersion</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseListVersion' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseListVersion</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;The version of the SPDX License List used in the license expression.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;The version of the SPDX License List used in the license expression.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Recognizing that licenses are added to the
SPDX License List &lt;https://spdx.org/licenses/&gt; with each
subsequent version, the intent is to provide consumers with the version of the
SPDX License List used.

This anticipates that in the future, license expression can used a
version of the SPDX License List that is older than the then current one.

The specified version of the SPDX License List shall include all listed licenses
and exceptions referenced in the expression.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
